      "message": "The current Dolby Vision profile doesn\u0027t include CCID info. That means we can\u0027t send CCID info to Dolby Vision codec via MediaFormat::KEY_PROFILE key/value pair.\n\nThe current Dolby Vision codec string doesn\u0027t include CCID info either.\n\nBut Dolby Vision codec needs this info to do initialization.\n\nSo we propose to add a new key to do this. (Similar as KEY_AAC_xxx)",
